From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kanaka Raju Nayana <kanaka.raju.nayana@intel.com>
Date: Tue, 9 Jun 2026 08:23:58 +0530
Subject: drm/xe: fix sysctl registration page fault on pre-6.5 kernels

Older kernels still rely on legacy sysctl table semantics and can fault
during register_sysctl when the observation table is not terminated as
expected.

Adjust the xe observation sysctl table for pre-6.5 behavior so module
init no longer crashes on 5.15.

Signed-off-by: Kanaka Raju Nayana <kanaka.raju.nayana@intel.com>
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/xe/xe_observation.c | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/xe/xe_observation.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/xe/xe_observation.c
index 6c27c8e..7dcf281 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/xe/xe_observation.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/xe/xe_observation.c
@@ -84,6 +84,9 @@ static const struct ctl_table observation_ctl_table[] = {
 	 .extra1 = SYSCTL_ZERO,
 	 .extra2 = SYSCTL_ONE,
 	 },
+#ifdef BPM_SYSCTL_TABLE_SENTINEL_NOT_PRESENT
+	{ }
+#endif
 };
 
 /**
